sion_date":"2023-08-22","session_datetime":"2023-08-22T11:06:00","session_id":"session_15","session_index":15,"source_sha256":"967c01aaa2141158daa2dc3c85fc919a51ebce9643d8bb45820096ec28dbb7b0","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":8},{"dia_id":"D15:9","global_turn_index":265,"locator":"[S15T9]","raw_turn_sha256":"9149495844c6d0efab8c6b5f86eb20440d131165f10522ff56f408f00cf08440","rendered_turn_sha256":"d190482b2dafdddc94cbcea454f37effd8cb8f22f6836b8fb978b4ff7791e992","session_date":"2023-08-22","session_datetime":"2023-08-22T11:06:00","session_id":"session_15","session_index":15,"source_sha256":"25fab13cfdd291b88d6f13b5d259c20639543245b0357e33ee1fa33ef4d9ec70","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":9},{"dia_id":"D15:10","global_turn_index":266,"locator":"[S15T10]","raw_turn_sha256":"9901b0291ff8e0b0a3fd35124d8e964e3bdacb96269fde36bac179d5f05e89b8","rendered_turn_sha256":"d0138c592f6803bbfd4d5b7fde78e3feff0838eb6da37e173dd674b8ed3ff2d7","session_date":"2023-08-22","session_datetime":"2023-08-22T11:06:00","session_id":"session_15","session_index":15,"source_sha256":"7c4f6656aaf11057ea3c33f648e693246b7e36baf28e41a95841f0f598714d45","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":10},{"dia_id":"D15:11","global_turn_index":267,"locator":"[S15T11]","raw_turn_sha256":"1c25222c6c3a1faf8f4284290b9c8e0915d5bf217b8de37069788de3487b53bc","rendered_turn_sha256":"a20f7918af3a3743c1134a14297b040487ac16fe9ea507c3adcc5508e69fc043","session_date":"2023-08-22","session_datetime":"2023-08-22T11:06:00","session_id":"session_15","session_index":15,"source_sha256":"1aeb1708d76b6b3f0b400f5fe333456b7ba36d60090278db2ccd5a53a8366b30","speaker":"Dave","turn_index":11},{"dia_id":"D15:12","global_turn_index":268,"locator":"[S15T12]","raw_turn_sha256":"aef8b059625f5a75ba11c783279502b8b6bd951e356885999d79f6372e4df0b3","rendered_turn_sha256":"2084e847d39185b8f273bef781a68daf40a5ce1236712732c99aa613dd742951","session_date":"2023-08-22","session_datetime":"2023-08-22T11:06:00","session_id":"session_15","session_index":15,"source_sha256":"1c8cd72afefed08ee163f6016223c92317fdb983145442f39ed962909a2443c3","speaker":"Calvin","turn_index":12}],"speaker":null,"store_id":"s1","store_snapshot_sha256":"ca39361e8e23f204a9fda55fc83e3ce7f411c7c8d582939aa63688c1923c7679","text":"Dave: Hey Calvin! Haven't talked in a while! Last Friday I had a card-night with my friends, it was so much fun. We laughed and had a great time! Take a look at the photo!\n[Image caption: a photography of a group of men sitting at a table with playing cards]\n[S15T1] (dia_id: D15:1)\n\nCalvin: Hey Dave! Great to hear from you, card night sounds like a blast! Always love having fun with friends. Guess what? I scored a deal to continue collaboration with Frank Ocean! This is a dream come true for me, I've been working hard and it's finally paying off. No words can describe how happy I am.\n[S15T2] (dia_id: D15:2)\n\nDave: Wow Calvin, congrats! Super excited for you. How did this chance come up?\n[S15T3] (dia_id: D15:3)\n\nCalvin: Thanks, Dave! I had the opportunity to meet Frank Ocean at a music festival in Tokyo and we clicked. We've been speaking and sharing ideas we arranged a meeting and recorded a song in the studio at my mansion - it's been great!\n[S15T4] (dia_id: D15:4)\n\nDave: Wow, Tokyo sounds like an incredible experience!\n[S15T5] (dia_id: D15:5)\n\nCalvin: It was an incredible experience, Dave! The city was buzzing with energy and the festival crowd was so lively - it was like fuel for my soul. Look at this photo, that's amazing!\n[Image caption: a photo of a crowd of people sitting on the grass at night]\n[S15T6] (dia_id: D15:6)\n\nDave: Wow, that sounds incredible! What was it like playing at the festival? Must have been an amazing experience.\n[S15T7] (dia_id: D15:7)\n\nCalvin: It was a dream come true, Dave! The festival had buzzing energy and a super upbeat crowd. We all felt connected, it was amazing!\n[S15T8] (dia_id: D15:8)\n\nDave: Sounds like you had a blast! Did any other collaborations come out of that performance? Any upcoming concerts we should know about?\n[S15T9] (dia_id: D15:9)\n\nCalvin: Yeah Dave, someone even noticed my performance and now we're working together, which is wild. My tour ends soon and I'm heading to Boston. Maybe we can meet up then!\n[S15T10] (dia_id: D15:10)\n\nDave: Sounds great! Fill me in on the details when you have them and let's meet up when you're here. Can't wait to hear all about everything!\n[S15T11] (dia_id: D15:11)\n\nCalvin: Of course, Dave can't wait to catch up! I almost forgot, yesterday my friends and I recorded a podcast where we discuss the rapidly evolving rap industry!\n[S15T12] (dia_id: D15:12)","text_sha256":"f9b0e40ff577d2e72eabcfa3a1116778bc90bb7df1a2732266997e4e7499f9f6","timestamp":"2023-08-22T11:06:00"},{"attribution_index_sha256":"08302ae53c7681312a62f5734d6ef73dfd8c86405ba319838bd79230cce094d2","attribution_units":[{"dia_ids":["D16:15"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":59,"line_start":58,"source_locators":["[S16T15]"],"text_sha256":"17d18dfa5dad6374ec64794b3e9a110d0b22fdcc1fb0d58e0a88a743730088c6"},{"dia_ids":["D16:16"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":62,"line_start":61,"source_locators":["[S16T16]"],"text_sha256":"92c765ec49cd314580d4b8b760b3a28ce4d26166a975768cf8cb2b9e1f241e68"},{"dia_ids":["D16:17"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":65,"line_start":64,"source_locators":["[S16T17]"],"text_sha256":"03940ee8349ed35a1bc06e9861150f7b62b75f708d695beab65f26e6d0f36d66"},{"dia_ids":["D16:18"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":69,"line_start":67,"source_locators":["[S16T18]"],"text_sha256":"35f2cda90c435b7cbc21c50b4b36f594fd51a681dcba938aa2dc0d1336cc373e"},{"dia_ids":["D16:19"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":72,"line_start":71,"source_locators":["[S16T19]"],"text_sha256":"edab688416b513b9e546d2fcb8509d20ba1d99dfef3b6043c74ba2c6b2a7e41d"},{"dia_ids":["D16:20"],"kind":"raw_turn","line_end":75,"line_start":74,"source_locators":["[S16T20]"],"text_sha256":"27061a29ed5a85951d151a1f37a91139d6470ea3cb53964df46612d49cecffda"},{"dia_ids":["D16:21"]